        {
          "id": "opening-paragraph",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 360,
          "content": "I am writing to express my strong interest in the Full Stack Developer position at Antigravity. With over 5 years of experience in developing scalable web applications and a proven track record of delivering high-quality solutions, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your engineering team.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 80,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#334155",
            "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "body-paragraph-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 460,
          "content": "In my current role at Antigravity, I have successfully led the development of multiple full-stack applications using React, Next.js, and Node.js. One of my key achievements includes architecting a microservices-based platform that improved system performance by 40% and reduced deployment time by 60%. I have extensive experience with TypeScript, PostgreSQL, and cloud services including AWS and Vercel.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 100,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#334155",
            "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "body-paragraph-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 580,
          "content": "I am particularly drawn to Antigravity's commitment to innovation and its reputation for developing cutting-edge solutions. Your work in AI-powered applications aligns perfectly with my expertise in integrating LLMs and creating intelligent features that deliver real business value. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my technical skills and collaborative mindset to your team.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 80,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#334155",
            "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "closing-paragraph",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 680,
          "content": "I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience and skills can benefit Antigravity. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to hearing from you soon.",
          "style": {
            "width": 674,
            "height": 60,
            "fontSize": 14,
            "fontWeight": 400,
            "color": "#334155",
            "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "lineHeight": 1.7
          },
          "pageIndex": 0
